Dependencies:
 SDL
 SDL_image
 SDL_mixer

On Ubuntu you can get all necessary packages by typing:
 sudo apt-get install g++ make libsdl-image1.2-dev libsdl-mixer1.2-dev

The Makefile lives at build/linux/Makefile; the top-level Makefile is a symlink
to it. From the top directory (the one with 'sources') you can 'make' and
'make install'.
